@@ -13,3 +13,13 @@ A small team notes app. Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind.
 ```bash
 npm run dev
 ```
+
+## Authentication
+
+Email + password and Google sign-in via [Better Auth](https://better-auth.com), stored in SQLite.
+
+1. `cp .env.example .env.local` and fill in the values (`openssl rand -base64 32` for the secret; Google OAuth client from Google Cloud Console, redirect URI `http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback/google`).
+2. Create the tables: `npx auth@latest migrate --config src/lib/auth.ts -y` (re-run after changing auth plugins).
+3. `npm run dev`
+
+`/dashboard` is gated in `src/proxy.ts` (cookie check) and re-validated server-side by `getCurrentUser()` in `src/lib/users.ts`.
